			"Message": "refactor(Sky): Update Wind import paths to Target/Element/Wind/Source structure\n\nThe Wind package was restructured to place compiled output under Target/Element/Wind/Source/. Update all import statements in Sky workbench entry points (Electron, BrowserProxy, Mountain, BrowserTest) and the Astro bundler config to reference the new paths.\n\nAffected imports: SkyEvent, Bootstrap, Install, LandWorkbenchGlobal, TauriMainProcessService, and Extensions ChangeStream. The astro.config.ts alias and external resolution rules are also updated to match the new Wind output layout.",
			"SHA": "7ac45453609a8f5b3632f7376655a72748e64216"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-10T12:53:23Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				155,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(Sky): Remove extraneous closing parenthesis in Electron bootstrap\n\nThe runBootstrap call in Source/Workbench/Electron/Bootstrap.ts had an extra closing parenthesis and trailing comma causing a syntax error. Fix the closing delimiter from `}),\n);` to `});\n` to match the expected function call structure.\n\nThis restores valid TypeScript syntax for the Electron render process bootstrap entry point in the Sky editor UI component layer.",
			"SHA": "2ce89804c75e32bf559da0b7a208f1184de2037c"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-10T12:44:35Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				155,
				1
			],
			"Message": "build(Sky): Add TypeScript incremental build cache file\n\nStage the tsconfig.tsbuildinfo artifact generated by TypeScript's incremental compilation mode. This cache accelerates subsequent builds by reusing type-checking results across runs.\n\nThe file is produced when running tsc with composite/incremental flags in the Sky editor UI component layer. Committing it ensures consistent incremental builds across developer environments and CI pipelines.",
			"SHA": "388ceda2d4fe0a9199e01172b4c49af688311e6d"
